# Pinned bytes are the evidence. A checkout that rewrites line endings changes
# the digest of a fixture and every claim recorded against it, so these trees
# are byte-exact on every platform. The scope is deliberate: this is not
# "* -text", which would also freeze ordinary source and documentation.
fixtures/**            -text
interop/**             -text
cross-impl-receipts/** -text
fixtures/manifest.json -text
